      "updated": 1786153816914,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Cold zone doubles as the service aisle. In a single-row room the\nentire room volume is the cold reservoir — there is no cold aisle\nto contain, only exhaust to capture.",
      "originalText": "Cold zone doubles as the service aisle. In a single-row room the entire room volume is the cold reservoir — there is no cold aisle to contain, only exhaust to capture.",
