      "updated": 1786153825382,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Overhead A/B busway runs the length of the single row. This is the one\nplace the narrow plan is EASIER than a two-row plan: one straight run,\ntap box per rack, no home runs to re-pull when a rack is added.",
      "originalText": "Overhead A/B busway runs the length of the single row. This is the one place the narrow plan is EASIER than a two-row plan: one straight run, tap box per rack, no home runs to re-pull when a rack is added.",
